    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100883" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνορίνω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ]</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rouse</i> or <i>stir up</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵνα οἱ σὺν θυμὸν ὀρίνῃς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					24.467
				</span></i>
			:— 
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνορινόμεναι κίνυντο φάλαγγες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					4.332
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέαρ συνορίνεται ἄτῃ</span>
			<i>is stirred up, agitated</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.56
			</span></i>.</div>
